        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7613107",
      "subQuestName": "调查左侧控制室",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "761310701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "761310701": {
            "id": "761310701",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "咦？这个东西好像还能用。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310702"
            ]
          },
          "761310702": {
            "id": "761310702",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "会不会有什么情报呢，打开看看。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310703"
            ]
          },
          "761310703": {
            "id": "761310703",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这就是那只星空生物传递给龙族的消息吗…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310704"
            ]
          },
          "761310704": {
            "id": "761310704",
            "speakerId": 22255,
            "speakerName": "黑蛋",
            "text": "原来是这样…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310705"
            ]
          },
          "761310705": {
            "id": "761310705",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "所以说，望月者计划，指的就是把这样的消息重新发送入宇宙？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310706"
            ]
          },
          "761310706": {
            "id": "761310706",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "只是这样的话，用那座「伊比尼伯龙之眼」就可以办到吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310707"
            ]
          },
          "761310707": {
            "id": "761310707",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "是不是还有什么内容我漏看了？我再检查一下！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310708"
            ]
          },
          "761310708": {
            "id": "761310708",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "呜哇！末尾果然还有一段注脚！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310709"
            ]
          },
          "761310709": {
            "id": "761310709",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "「给我的『女儿』，宁宁」",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310710"
            ]
          },
          "761310710": {
            "id": "761310710",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "宁宁？！等等…黑蛋，你是卢沙里姆的女儿？！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310711"
            ]
          },
          "761310711": {
            "id": "761310711",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "那你怎么也变成了现在这个样子？！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310712"
            ]
          },
          "761310712": {
            "id": "761310712",
            "speakerId": 22255,
            "speakerName": "黑蛋",
            "text": "怎么会…我不知道…我没有这些记忆。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310713"
            ]
          },
          "761310713": {
            "id": "761310713",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我们得去月心那里看看。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310714"
            ]
          },
          "761310714": {
            "id": "761310714",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "那、那哥伦比娅呢？还没找到她消失的线索…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310715"
            ]
          },
          "761310715": {
            "id": "761310715",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "她的消失或许也和月心有关。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310716"
            ]
          },
          "761310716": {
            "id": "761310716",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "对哦，她前面说的熟悉的感觉，也只可能是月心了…我们快走！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7613101",
      "subQuestName": "调查机关",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "761310901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "761310901": {
            "id": "761310901",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这个东西是不是可以关闭警戒设施？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310902"
            ]
          },
          "761310902": {
            "id": "761310902",
            "speakerId": 22261,
            "speakerName": "黑蛋",
            "text": "没错，这就是警戒控制器。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310903"
            ]
          },
          "761310903": {
            "id": "761310903",
            "speakerId": 22261,
            "speakerName": "黑蛋",
            "text": "但是似乎要在短时间内将这里和右侧房间的警戒控制器一起关闭才行。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310904"
            ]
          },
          "761310904": {
            "id": "761310904",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "也就是说，关闭了这里的控制器后，要尽快抵达另一间控制室，对吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310905"
            ]
          },
          "761310905": {
            "id": "761310905",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我明白了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
